## Why This Is Asked
Tests an engineer's ability to design streaming, batch-friendly top-k maintenance with exact counts, including amortized analysis, space trade-offs, and real-time retrieval.

## Key Concepts
- Streaming updates, batch processing
- Hash maps for counts, min-heap for top-k with lazy updates
- Amortized analysis and cache-friendly behavior
- Space vs accuracy: exact top-k vs partial summaries

## Code Example
